OpenFusion Android
==================

This repository contains modifications and additions for building an Android FusionFall client
on top of Winlator.

Upstream project: Winlator
Upstream repository: https://github.com/brunodev85/winlator-app
Pinned source revision: 4f55d117fff1542944e5b91f433470445160ce08
Upstream license: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later

The files under android-overlay/ were added by OpenFusion Android contributors. The file
patches/winlator-4f55d11.patch records modifications to the pinned Winlator source. Modified
files carry a notice identifying the OpenFusion Android changes and their date.

The build downloads the official OpenFusion portable launcher at build/runtime setup time; that
launcher is not vendored into this repository and is governed by its own licenses.

